{
  "day": 9,
  "title": "Future simple — will",
  "units": [
    {
      "id": 15,
      "code": "G",
      "title": "Future simple (will)",
      "rule": "*Will* — kelajak zamon: *will* + feʼl, hamma ega bilan bir xil: *I will help you.* — Men sizga yordam beraman. *It will be hot.* — Issiq boʻladi. Qisqa shakllari: *I'll, he'll, she'll, we'll, they'll*. Inkor: *will not* = *won't*: *It won't rain.* — Yomgʻir yogʻmaydi. Savol: *Will you come? — Yes, I will. / No, I won't.* *Tomorrow, next year, soon* soʻzlari bilan keladi.",
      "examples": [
        "I will help you.",
        "It will be hot tomorrow.",
        "Bekzod will be a doctor.",
        "We'll go to Tashkent next year.",
        "She won't come today.",
        "Will you come to the party?"
      ],
      "words": [
        { "en": "will", "uz": "…adi (kelajak)" },
        { "en": "won't", "uz": "…maydi (kelajak, inkor)" },
        { "en": "tomorrow", "uz": "ertaga" },
        { "en": "next year", "uz": "kelasi yil" },
        { "en": "soon", "uz": "tez orada" },
        { "en": "help", "uz": "yordam bermoq" },
        { "en": "call", "uz": "qoʻngʻiroq qilmoq" },
        { "en": "forget", "uz": "unutmoq" }
      ],
      "text": {
        "title": "Next year",
        "en": "Dilnoza: Bekzod, what will you do next year?\nBekzod: I will go to Tashkent. I will be a doctor.\nDilnoza: Will you come home at the weekend?\nBekzod: Yes, I will. I won't forget you! I'll call you every day.\nDilnoza: Good. I will help you with English.\nBekzod: Thanks. Will Tom be sad?\nDilnoza: No, he won't. He will sleep on the sofa!"
      },
      "exercises": {
